    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:1em; border:1px solid #999; font-size:90%; text-align:center; background:#363636\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td><i>This article details the Poison Resistance Feat found in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a>. You may be looking for the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> Feat of the same name, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison_Resistance_(NRCG)\" title=\"Poison Resistance (NRCG)\">Poison Resistance</a>.</i></td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are naturally more resistant to the effects of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +5 bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> when attacked by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a>. If the attack succeeds, you take only half damage.</p>",
